Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.68,0:00:12.02,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在心灵的街道中{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.92,0:00:18.48,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪耀着希望之光{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.26,0:00:24.66,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用虚幻的羽翼挥动着梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:30.97,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你与我寻找的目标
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:47.41,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真理总是隐藏在眼中 蓝蓝的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.99,0:00:54.39,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要往何处去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.40,0:01:01.20,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩人未来与现今的流浪{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.64,0:01:06.70,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续踏上旅程{\fad(0,50)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.98,0:01:13.71,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远的目标地 无止尽的梦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.25,0:01:24.65,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望能不放手不断追寻 直到永远{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.95,0:01:50.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.32,0:01:55.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都已经在战国时代念了书
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.35,0:01:57.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且一边听着犬夜叉的冷嘲热讽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.62,0:01:59.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特地跑回来的说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.33,0:02:02.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:03.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,写得顺吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.89,0:02:06.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.13,0:02:11.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天的考试很容易吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.44,0:02:12.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.48,0:02:23.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第69话 恐怖的无脸男人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.39,0:02:37.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.33,0:02:39.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和他进展如何了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.36,0:02:39.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.93,0:02:41.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对对对对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.47,0:02:43.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个不良少年的他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.33,0:02:44.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是不良少年啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.67,0:02:46.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,劈腿的他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.37,0:02:49.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实他也不是劈腿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.91,0:02:51.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那要怎么说呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.48,0:02:55.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柏拉图…式的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.18,0:02:56.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柏拉图式的？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:02:58.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柏拉图式的劈腿？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.15,0:03:01.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再说劈腿了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.32,0:03:04.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 我之前就想跟你说了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.46,0:03:05.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.56,0:03:06.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙不太好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.16,0:03:08.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对呀 不太好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.93,0:03:10.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么突然这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.66,0:03:11.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是坏人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.33,0:03:12.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是坏人喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.40,0:03:13.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是坏人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.00,0:03:15.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么说是坏人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.67,0:03:17.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他又任性又粗鲁吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.04,0:03:19.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.00,0:03:21.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还会吃醋吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.97,0:03:25.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他知道北条同学的事情吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.21,0:03:28.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想他应该不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.71,0:03:32.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么那家伙到底是在吃谁的醋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.72,0:03:33.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是钢牙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.02,0:03:35.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.02,0:03:40.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和钢牙没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.59,0:03:41.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么都没有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.53,0:03:44.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他有什么理由要吃醋呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:46.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.30,0:03:49.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙说他迷恋我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:52.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇也劈腿？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.24,0:03:54.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.97,0:03:59.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有特别喜欢或讨厌钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.24,0:04:00.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.74,0:04:02.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇在我们不知道的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:04.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么有人缘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.62,0:04:06.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才没有人缘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:08.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙只是单方面的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.05,0:04:11.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是单方面也受到表白了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.32,0:04:12.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.62,0:04:15.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被某人说“我迷恋上你了”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.90,0:04:19.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我~
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:21.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迷恋上你了~
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.27,0:04:25.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇真了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.00,0:04:28.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是被这么说也就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.51,0:04:30.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还被别人问过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.41,0:04:32.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愿不愿意帮他生孩子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.84,0:04:34.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是哪个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:36.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.21,0:04:37.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不良的他？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.08,0:04:39.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个都不是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.65,0:04:42.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第三个男人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.72,0:04:43.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.72,0:04:46.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会这么说绝对是年纪大的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.36,0:04:47.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他确实年纪比较大
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.86,0:04:49.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他好像已经有心上人了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.16,0:04:51.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不伦之恋吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.23,0:04:52.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样不好吧 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.60,0:04:54.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实没什么大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.67,0:04:56.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是不论碰到谁都会这么问的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.10,0:04:59.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.11,0:05:08.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为我生孩子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.75,0:05:13.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以说真的什么事都没有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.95,0:05:20.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是戈薇 怎么会跟这些人在一起呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.02,0:05:22.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 连现在的男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:24.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎都是不良少年
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.19,0:05:26.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钢牙好像也很强势
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:29.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样北条同学就没胜算了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.27,0:05:32.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇好像比较喜欢强势的类型吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:34.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.34,0:05:35.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是刚好这个情形
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.57,0:05:37.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你绝对会吃男生的亏
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.14,0:05:40.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎会有个不幸的婚姻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.78,0:05:42.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再说些有的没的了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.41,0:05:43.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:44.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.41,0:05:46.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟那个不良少年 最近怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.92,0:05:47.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.15,0:05:49.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进展顺利吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.79,0:05:53.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺利…也没什么特别的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.36,0:05:55.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过没有问题就是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.59,0:05:56.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是很顺利嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.09,0:05:59.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是很喜欢他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.16,0:06:01.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 到此为止啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:02.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不该为你担心的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.07,0:06:05.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 随你高兴吧 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.00,0:06:08.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过这样不是很好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.82,0:06:21.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.96,0:06:29.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算数考试 82分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.33,0:06:31.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很努力嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.90,0:06:33.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐 82分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:36.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好好 很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.63,0:06:40.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做什么啦 姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.47,0:06:43.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次以满分为目标努力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.54,0:06:44.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好难受
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.54,0:06:46.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了 到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.14,0:06:47.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开饭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.34,0:06:48.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.65,0:06:49.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.41,0:06:51.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.55,0:06:57.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.29,0:06:59.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那边有好好的吃饭吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.79,0:07:02.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,青菜或山菜等等
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.73,0:07:04.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本没有像这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.93,0:07:07.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你就尽量的吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:09.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次什么时候要去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.30,0:07:12.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考试也结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.44,0:07:15.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先好好的睡个觉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.64,0:07:19.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天也去上课 之后再去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.75,0:07:23.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考试怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.01,0:07:25.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要问啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.58,0:07:27.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是没办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.52,0:07:30.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为戈薇在那边也很辛苦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.76,0:07:35.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.69,0:07:39.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.70,0:07:42.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:47.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道大家在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.17,0:07:51.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 管他的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.44,0:07:53.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:06.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇不在好寂寞喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.43,0:08:10.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 没什么不同吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.43,0:08:13.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骗人 我统统知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.06,0:08:16.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉常常发呆
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.53,0:08:18.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是在想戈薇没错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.30,0:08:21.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙 你搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.44,0:08:25.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇说这次什么时候回来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.68,0:08:30.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一 二 三…明天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.28,0:08:33.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天就回来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.45,0:08:36.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们快点回村子迎接戈薇吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.45,0:08:39.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我到处闻过了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.56,0:08:41.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是没有半点收获
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.83,0:08:43.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘不在的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.09,0:08:47.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在很难掌握四魂之玉的所在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.73,0:08:50.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连奈落的线索也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.10,0:08:52.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是能闻到那家伙的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.97,0:08:55.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就能找到他了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.12,0:09:15.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想出来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.73,0:09:20.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.51,0:09:35.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁？是弟弟吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.11,0:09:38.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那和你们不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.28,0:09:40.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.90,0:09:55.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头目 这次要袭击哪个村子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.50,0:09:58.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论是酒或女人都很多的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.67,0:10:01.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.27,0:10:04.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.41,0:10:06.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头目 请您过来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.18,0:10:08.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.55,0:10:11.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.28,0:10:13.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是活的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.52,0:10:17.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真恶心 宰了它
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.39,0:10:18.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.19,0:10:23.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.93,0:10:31.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.70,0:10:32.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.07,0:10:35.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有…没有脸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.22,0:10:51.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.59,0:10:58.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有错吗 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.83,0:11:01.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这味道我怎么可能会弄错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.36,0:11:02.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这边
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.87,0:11:05.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的味道愈来愈浓了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.57,0:11:07.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落与人的血腥味
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:20.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都被杀光了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.62,0:11:24.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人是强盗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.12,0:11:25.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.22,0:11:27.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.09,0:11:32.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙的脸被剥走了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.73,0:11:33.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.76,0:11:34.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.47,0:11:36.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边也是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.87,0:11:40.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.87,0:11:42.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个人的脸都不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.97,0:11:45.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好诡异喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.98,0:11:49.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这太不寻常了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.41,0:11:51.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的杰作吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.28,0:11:53.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是为什么要对脸下手
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:20.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,邪气的源头就是你吧 妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.31,0:12:27.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么 这家伙竟然没有脸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.18,0:12:28.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双师父
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.19,0:12:30.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先退下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.79,0:12:31.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.96,0:12:35.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪 你从哪里来的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.06,0:12:38.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从…哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.16,0:12:39.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:42.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何要做这么残酷的事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.33,0:12:44.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脸…给我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.30,0:12:46.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脸？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.57,0:12:49.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为想要脸而杀人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.34,0:12:50.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可恶的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.81,0:12:52.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脸…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.81,0:12:54.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无双师父
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.58,0:12:56.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要将你这邪恶的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.35,0:12:58.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铲除！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.32,0:12:59.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.22,0:13:03.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:31.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的脸 脸啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.90,0:13:53.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 这张脸不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.27,0:13:56.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无礼的家伙 我砍了你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.41,0:13:58.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然有了张不错的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.14,0:14:01.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还要把好刀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.65,0:14:04.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的刀看起来不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.52,0:14:09.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是好刀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.79,0:14:12.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙到底是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.34,0:15:01.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.84,0:15:04.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不够
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.18,0:15:06.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要更多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.61,0:15:08.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要更多…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.34,0:15:10.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.36,0:15:24.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次就找那个村子下手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.96,0:15:28.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那村子…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.73,0:15:33.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:43.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我站住
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.65,0:15:51.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.76,0:15:54.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到你了 臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.74,0:16:07.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.24,0:16:08.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.37,0:16:09.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要小心喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.74,0:16:11.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己多保重呀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.54,0:16:16.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次看都觉得不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.65,0:16:19.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么只有姐姐能去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.25,0:16:23.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能说这就是戈薇的命运吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.16,0:16:26.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了对了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.19,0:16:29.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了能让她随时都能回来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.39,0:16:30.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得去买点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.93,0:16:31.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也要去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:33.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:39.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.87,0:16:40.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.94,0:16:42.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少装蒜了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.34,0:16:44.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是奈落的分身吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.51,0:16:46.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身上充满了那家伙的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.18,0:16:49.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我的事情吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.61,0:16:51.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.95,0:16:53.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.22,0:16:55.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 看样子不是奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.22,0:16:57.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该都是这家伙的杰作
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.89,0:16:59.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确 这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.49,0:17:01.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散发出与奈落相同的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.53,0:17:04.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀害强盗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.73,0:17:06.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夺取脸的人就是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.26,0:17:08.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.46,0:17:11.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是每个都很粗糙所以不能用
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.37,0:17:14.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是这个 还不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.64,0:17:16.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也是抢来的脸吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.74,0:17:17.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.64,0:17:19.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是想要张不错的脸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.68,0:17:21.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钱和女人我统统都想要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.21,0:17:23.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我统统都试着去抢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.88,0:17:25.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是也不行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.48,0:17:27.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有点不对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.68,0:17:30.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 我到底想要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.65,0:17:31.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.49,0:17:33.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子他不是在开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.39,0:17:35.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连自己是谁都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.26,0:17:37.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和以前的奈落分身完全不同
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:48.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们果然碰面了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.97,0:17:50.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙是从我奈落身上诞生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.01,0:17:53.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最令人作呕的肉块
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.68,0:17:56.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 对你而言也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.45,0:17:59.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.05,0:18:01.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,袭击前面的村子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.78,0:18:03.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还放火烧了它的也是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.29,0:18:04.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.79,0:18:06.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来以为把人杀光
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.52,0:18:09.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎能让我想起什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.99,0:18:11.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但还是没用
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.29,0:18:13.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是很痛快而已
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.53,0:18:15.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.53,0:18:17.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说了我想不起来嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:22.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 叫无双如何
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.74,0:18:26.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫做无双 不错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.28,0:18:29.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是给我这张脸的和尚的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.55,0:18:34.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你？是你杀了他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.32,0:18:37.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么嘴脸 有够碍眼的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.62,0:18:39.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你才是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.29,0:18:40.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.59,0:18:43.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得你的嘴脸很碍眼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.56,0:18:45.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 我们以前见过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.00,0:18:46.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:49.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再问下去也没有结果
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.33,0:18:51.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.73,0:18:53.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散发奈落味道的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.34,0:18:55.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又胡乱的四处杀人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.84,0:18:57.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,砍死你的理由很充分了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.84,0:18:59.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试试看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.65,0:19:05.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接招
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.59,0:19:10.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.36,0:19:14.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没有
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.60,0:19:18.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.50,0:19:19.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.14,0:19:22.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仿佛是制造出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.88,0:19:30.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落的毒虫
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.13,0:19:44.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的手臂…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.63,0:19:48.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毒虫混入了他的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.53,0:19:51.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样我的风穴就不能用了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.41,0:19:55.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真厉害耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.14,0:19:58.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个村子里有什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.64,0:20:00.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在胡扯什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.18,0:20:02.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个村子在呼唤着我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.58,0:20:04.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次只要将村人杀光
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.18,0:20:06.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎就能想起什么吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.55,0:20:07.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.43,0:20:13.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.20,0:20:19.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.43,0:20:22.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.61,0:20:29.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙蛮强的 小心一点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.94,0:20:32.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 毕竟是奈落的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.35,0:20:33.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有啥了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.45,0:20:38.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.18,0:20:39.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.92,0:20:42.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.46,0:20:44.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.99,0:20:47.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.46,0:20:48.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.69,0:20:49.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.46,0:20:51.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我来迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.20,0:20:53.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别过来 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.10,0:20:55.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.14,0:21:02.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.24,0:21:04.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙是奈落的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.14,0:21:06.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你退到后面去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.75,0:21:13.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那女人…是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.12,0:21:16.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在发什么呆啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.46,0:21:17.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.72,0:21:21.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 砍断了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.89,0:21:24.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么 这是为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.76,0:21:26.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女人？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.23,0:21:30.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 是那女人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.50,0:21:32.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在自言自语什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.24,0:21:33.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一口气决胜负吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.77,0:21:34.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那女人 滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.74,0:21:36.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.81,0:21:37.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.45,0:21:40.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:43.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.65,0:21:45.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.75,0:21:49.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.79,0:21:50.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.29,0:21:55.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.83,0:21:58.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？这家伙是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.03,0:22:01.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是想得到这女人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.18,0:22:21.42,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,究竟要流多少泪{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.22,0:22:28.25,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  才能坦白面对自己
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.06,0:22:35.02,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倘若对谁传达情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.80,0:22:42.04,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Every Heart  是否就能得到满足{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.28,0:22:48.31,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕着漫长漫长的夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.75,0:22:55.18,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝着遥远的星星祈祷着{\fad(0,250)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.99,0:23:02.22,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.03,0:23:08.80,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找真正的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.50,0:23:15.81,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望自己能够变得更坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.28,0:23:22.31,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天也要抬头看着高高的天空{\fad(0,100)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.08,0:23:29.08,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在不停流转的时空之中{\fad(150,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.82,0:23:35.52,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在寻找生命的意义{\fad(0,350)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.07,0:23:50.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.24,0:23:51.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明是奈落的分身
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.34,0:23:52.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然连奈落的名字都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.98,0:23:55.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐告诉犬夜叉一行人 无双的下落
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.12,0:23:57.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在五十年前
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.48,0:24:00.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗藏匿强盗鬼蜘蛛的洞窟里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.35,0:24:01.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞不好是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.35,0:24:03.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是去了应该能了解些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.62,0:24:06.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且这段期间 奈落为了抹杀桔梗而行动
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.83,0:24:08.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.09,0:24:10.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再次苏醒的鬼蜘蛛记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.10,0:24:12.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五十年前的因缘
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.60,0:24:15.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一次就做个了断吧
